==Trivia==
* [[John Cochran]] is the first castaway to obtain two separate challenge advantages in a season.
** [[Danni Boatwright]] is the first castaway to obtain a challenge advantage in two separate seasons.
* [[Chris Underwood]] is the first castaway to have both an advantage and a disadvantage for the same challenge.
* The [[Hina]] tribe is the first tribe to receive a disadvantage as a whole. Its members are also the first players to receive a disadvantage and then still go on to win the challenge.
